<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-18T16:02:14.126Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:02:14 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard and Japan Coast Guard conducted an anti-piracy drill in Manila Bay, while the United States and the Philippines carried out their 16th bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea. The PCG opened an upgraded station on Pag-asa Island and monitored several Chinese naval assets near Scarborough Shoal, after Chinese envoy Jing Quan warned China could easily win a conflict with the Philippines, prompting PCG Rear Admiral Jay Tarriela to label the remark a direct threat. The PCG also rescued four people, including a child, stranded on Hagonoy Island in Surigao del Sur. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiO0FVX3lxTE8xdTROalVOQXRWVmVKRVlwWTM1X2hGU1NKcVNJNW9WaW5tZHpNVWJMTWZyak41ajF1RDVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Howl.link&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPcW95RjJncXFsS0lUM250VTM1RW1Jbm9nLWd0bmRLM1A3YVBKaVF6U3ZhYXFzSkpMV3lTUnJfNjFHQjZPUWF1ZGI5MGpTbjgwYU9DNE9leURELW9QcEZZbElpZGZOMVhaZEhfNjRmNklZWFZYMUpNbnFMMWVaTVJjVS1xQWV6TjZpSnlxaUxrSGtxSDlLZVB3WFpzRnZsbDduUmhabWgzVWhRQ1VvSlAwcnZOM1phZGZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNMFhkSUlYZWR0MjZScEgtNkVwNHB1SjM3YnRkWmo0RHRDN0h2SWszb1gwVW4zcDU1STFuR25FU3d3bGQ3aU1NSU5nMkk4Y0pQY05hR2tsOFVVMm9oOGFseTFhalRyNFE2dV9xYnloRXpOemE4RnFoZEVjaUc2QzhkVVhnMzlwdTFTbEJHY2tZQlk0WVMwbHdRaGFQejNqMG9pQ1AzVUh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPQXNxdFJ6RnBiS2hqZXN5WGg2cXlGUHVqS2lnbU9wNUhuR2JZeXlVRlJnTVdTWEJoNmQ2cXc1d25fQUZLSFprdWh4TFNwYkJZQU1kc3EtYVRVdlZ